{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And you shall eat old long-stored.</b> The produce will keep well and be good for aging — so that the old long-stored of three years will be finer to eat than last year's (Bava Batra 91)." "<b>And you shall clear out the old because of the new.</b> That the threshing floors will be full of new and the storehouses full of old, and you will need to clear out the storehouses to another place, to put the new into them (ibid.)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:35.014258376Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}